      en: ["Part of the most populous municipality of Serravalle", "Named after the locally prominent Berloni family", "Situated on a ridge overlooking the Ausa Valley", "Transformed from an agricultural estate to a residential area", "Located near the commercial and industrial hub of Dogana", "Features panoramic views reaching the Adriatic Sea"],
