      en: ["Faetano di Sotto refers to the lower district of the Faetano castello.", "It was incorporated into San Marino in 1463.", "The area features a mix of industrial zones and residential housing.", "It is located close to the border with the Italian province of Rimini.", "The terrain is flatter compared to most of the mountainous republic.", "Agriculture remains prominent in the areas surrounding the industrial lots."],
