      en: ["Sottomonte is situated at the base of Mount Titano's cliffs.", "The district contains the lower station of the San Marino City cable car.", "Over 100,000 refugees sheltered in local tunnels during World War II.", "Major tunnels of the Rimini-San Marino highway emerge in this area.", "The locality acts as a primary hub for the Republic's bus network.", "Modern sports facilities and public parks are located within the district."],
